<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">Interpreter access granted</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3f4f6;">
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" dir="ltr" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">
      <tr><td style="height:4px;line-height:4px;font-size:0;background-color:#0f766e;" bgcolor="#0f766e">&nbsp;</td></tr>
      <tr><td align="left" style="padding:24px 32px 8px;"><img src="https://cdn.example.com/logo.png" alt="WM Health Istanbul" height="40" style="display:block;height:40px;width:auto;max-width:220px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td></tr>
      <tr><td dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:16px 32px 24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;text-align:left;"><div dir="ltr" lang="en"><p>You can now be assigned to interpret online consultations. Your existing account and permissions stay the same.</p><p><strong>Before your first consultation:</strong></p><ol><li>Sign in with your existing account and open the interpreter panel.</li><li>Turn on two-step verification for your account.</li><li>Read and accept the interpreter confidentiality undertaking.</li></ol></div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#0f766e" style="padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#0f766e;"><a href="http://localhost:3000/en/interpreter" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;line-height:20px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;">Open the interpreter panel</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
      <tr><td dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:20px 32px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;text-align:left;"><p style="margin:0 0 6px;"><strong style="color:#374151;">WM Health Istanbul</strong></p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;">Internal notification — for authorised staff only.</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;">This email was sent automatically.</p></td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Interpreter access granted",
  "text": "You can now be assigned to interpret online consultations. Your existing account and permissions stay the same.
Before your first consultation:
- Sign in with your existing account and open the interpreter panel.
- Turn on two-step verification for your account.
- Read and accept the interpreter confidentiality undertaking.

Open the interpreter panel (http://localhost:3000/en/interpreter)
----
WM Health Istanbul
Internal notification — for authorised staff only.
This email was sent automatically.",
}
`;

